WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.767
Former US

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.368
President Jimmy

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.402
Carter is receiving

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.437
hospice care at home right now

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.705
at the age of 98.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.906
As people around the world

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:07.741
send him

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.709
wishes of comfort and peace,

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.311
they're also celebrating

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.412
his accomplishments.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:13.913
Among the most memorable,

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:14.581
his fight

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.149
against a tropical disease

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.584
called Guinea Worm.

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:19.119
It's caused by a parasite

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:20.687
which infects people and animals

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:21.621
when they drink water

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.989
that is contaminated.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:23.623
We're about to show

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:25.358
you disturbing pictures

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.494
of some of the complications.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.662
Carter traveled to Nigeria

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.731
and Ghana to see firsthand.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.800
About 3.5 million

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.403
people had the parasite in the mid 1980s

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:36.970
when Carter

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.473
turned his attention to the problem.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.142
The worm comes out of a joint,

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:43.943
so you and your knee

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.546
swells up and destroys the tissue.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.048
So the aftermath is very similar

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:48.782
to polio.

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:50.450
It completely debilitate suddenly

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.751
and sometimes in

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:52.786
the legs

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:54.821
is crippled for the rest of one's life.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:56.523
And of course, these kids can't

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:57.724
go to school.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:58.725
The pain is too great.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.693
And they need medical care.

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:01.494
And if it's an adult,

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:02.462
they can't go into the field

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.863
to plant their crops.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:06.366
And it's a devastating blow economically.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.935
Obviously, the personal pain is terrible.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.272
The Nobel Peace Prize winner

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:14.407
traveled to one village in Nigeria

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.576
where nearly everyone had Guinea worm

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:21.181
We were driving along and it seemed

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.382
elementary school children

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:23.850
had a big sign and says,

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:24.884
watch out, Guinea worm.

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.853
Here comes Jimmy Carter.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.489
That was almost as good as a Nobel Prize.

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:33.493
We in 2015

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.561
when Carter announced

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:35.428
that cancer

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.796
had actually spread to his brain.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.298
He immediately turned the spotlight

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:38.965
to Guinea worm,

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:39.933
saying that he wanted it

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.135
to be completely eradicated before

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.070
he dies.

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.438
The Carter Center says

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.507
case numbers were down to just 13,

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:51.978
just 13 from 3.5 million to 13 last year.

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:53.446
Time now for the exchange.

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:54.647
Joining me live now is Adam

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:55.982
Bice, the director

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.150
for the Carter Center's

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.252
Guinea Worm Eradication Program.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:01:59.719
Adam,

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.020
thank you so much for being with us.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.688
What a legacy.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:02.989
I mean, this is incredible.

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.124
The people who don't really know

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:06.092
much about Guinea worm,

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.393
just explain to us

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:08.461
how dangerous it is

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:10.263
and how widespread of an issue

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.531
it was of a health concern.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:12.565
It was

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.033
before Jimmy Carter

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:15.568
sort of turned his attention

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:16.870
to it back in the mid 1980s.

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:19.339
Well, thanks so much

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.241
for having a strong need today.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:23.376
Certainly you saw in the intro footage.

00:02:23.877 --> 00:02:25.145
Guinea worm is a terrible

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:28.648
nasty disease debilitates it cripples

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:31.618
and also leads to secondary infection.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:33.786
But this three foot

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:34.320
long worm

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.922
that comes out of people a year

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.224
after they become initially exposed to

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:41.261
the disease was across 21 countries

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:44.731
in Africa the Middle East and Asia

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:47.100
mostly however in sub-Saharan Africa.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:48.935
And it's just absolutely

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:49.769
devastating three

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:50.837
and a half million people

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:52.839
per year in 1986.

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:56.276
And once President Carter and others

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:57.877
really got involved

00:02:57.877 --> 00:02:59.012
they were able to really

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:00.146
bring those cases down.

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:00.747
And as you said

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:02.248
just 13 last year

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:04.350
which is really an amazing feat.

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:06.052
I have so many questions,

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.120
but I think the first one is

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.122
why did Carter I mean this

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.957
this of all the illnesses

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.458
around the world.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:13.059
Guinea worm

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.195
certainly is not the most famous,

00:03:15.195 --> 00:03:17.297
the most funded, the most well known.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.531
Why did President Carter

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.899
turn his attention

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.134
to this one in particular?

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:23.169
President

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:24.571
Carter turned his attention to it

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:26.172
for some of those very reasons.

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:27.473
It was neglected

00:03:27.473 --> 00:03:29.075
before people even were talking

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:31.844
about neglected tropical diseases.

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:32.912
He was helping shine

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.247
a spotlight on people

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.381
that were disconnected

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:38.284
politically, socially and economically.

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:40.920
And really based on his own character

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.189
and his own beliefs that we're all equal

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.258
and we are a human rights

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.327
and health is a human right.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.063
And making that connection very early on,

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:52.532
he really saw that this was something

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:54.000
that needed to be taken on.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.635
And I think the other piece to add

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:56.402
is that,

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:57.003
you know,

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:57.904
this is a disease

00:03:57.904 --> 00:04:00.707
oftentimes is of the most marginalized.

00:04:00.707 --> 00:04:02.508
And this was a real opportunity

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:04.377
to show the world that that, in fact,

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:05.645
we were addressing those

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:06.913
challenges hand-in-hand.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:08.248
So from

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:12.185
3.5 million people in 1986.

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:14.287
So we're talking

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:17.090
almost 40 years later to just 13.

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:18.558
I mean what is involved in that?

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:21.294
Just take us through the step by step

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:23.997
just in terms of what is involved in

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.999
virtually I would say completely

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:27.533
eradicating a disease.

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:29.269
How did you get started

00:04:30.036 --> 00:04:31.771
So really the foundation

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:33.740
is working in partnership

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.541
with the National Ministries of Health.

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.210
That is the core of

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.579
how the global program has operated.

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:41.281
It's not a Carter Center program,

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:42.982
it is the national ministries

00:04:42.982 --> 00:04:44.317
that lead the charge.

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:45.451
So setting up community

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:47.220
based surveillance systems,

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.455
just like in COVID 19 pandemic,

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.424
you have to know where the diseases

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:53.793
in order to implement interventions.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:54.927
Of course,

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.996
knowing that we do have one or two hands

00:04:56.996 --> 00:04:58.431
tied behind our back in

00:04:58.431 --> 00:05:00.967
that we do not have a vaccine or a cure

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.636
or a therapy to treat it,

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:04.103
but really

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:05.538
making sure we know where it is.

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:06.773
And then through peer

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:08.474
to peer health education,

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.276
through very simple pipe

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:11.377
straw filters

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:13.112
donated by Vestergaard friends and

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:14.881
making sure that

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:16.215
people really understand

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:17.383
how the disease works

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:17.817
That is,

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.585
if you have it or an animal has it

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:21.154
and they enter water,

00:05:21.154 --> 00:05:22.955
they infect that water source,

00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:24.490
and anybody who might use that

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.591
water source

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:27.026
can become infected

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:28.528
about one year later,

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:30.797
which makes the behavior change component

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:34.367
very complicated and difficult.

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:36.803
President Carter is in hospice

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.440
You know, he is almost 100 years old.

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:40.673
I mean,

00:05:40.673 --> 00:05:42.542
this is a huge part of his legacy.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.910
I mean, you think about

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:44.877
what he's achieved

00:05:44.877 --> 00:05:46.379
and everybody talks about, you know,

00:05:46.379 --> 00:05:48.581
going from a peanut farmer in Georgia

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:49.816
to becoming president.

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:50.850
And that is amazing.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:51.784
That is quite a feat.

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:54.053
However, it's things like this,

00:05:54.053 --> 00:05:54.420
you know,

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.456
that he will really be remembered

00:05:56.456 --> 00:05:58.891
for the lives that he touched especially.

00:05:58.891 --> 00:06:00.827
I mean, also covers Africa quite a bit.

00:06:00.827 --> 00:06:02.495
So especially for me

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:04.163
as someone who is from West Africa,

00:06:04.163 --> 00:06:04.864
this means so much.

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:06.766
And you travel to a village in my country

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:08.368
how much comfort

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:11.604
does this give President Carter that he

00:06:11.604 --> 00:06:13.005
I mean, not many of my buddies

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:14.874
was actually saying in my ear

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:16.609
before we went to you

00:06:16.609 --> 00:06:17.443
there aren't that many people

00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:18.778
in the world who can say

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:20.513
they are behind the near

00:06:20.513 --> 00:06:21.414
the ratification

00:06:21.414 --> 00:06:23.416
eradication, rather, of a disease.

00:06:23.416 --> 00:06:23.583
I mean,

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:25.451
that is an incredible achievement.

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:27.620
How much comfort does that give

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:30.089
President Carter in his final days?

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:32.925
Well, right now, he's he's

00:06:32.925 --> 00:06:33.926
very much at peace

00:06:33.926 --> 00:06:36.129
with his wife and family at home.

00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:38.931
He also smiled the other day

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:40.299
when he received a report

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:41.467
that as of right now,

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:43.503
we have zero human infections

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:44.670
in the world.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.340
So, again, we we do expect

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.541
some cases this year

00:06:48.541 --> 00:06:50.943
that's not going to surprise us.

00:06:50.943 --> 00:06:52.412
But he is very much humbled

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:54.147
by the strong leadership

00:06:54.147 --> 00:06:56.382
of the national ministries of Health.

00:06:56.382 --> 00:06:57.950
We are actually just in meetings

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.852
with several ministers of health.

00:06:59.852 --> 00:07:01.087
They're leading the charge.

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:03.089
And they know that while his days

00:07:03.089 --> 00:07:04.824
might well be numbered,

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:07.193
that they're going to carry on the legacy

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:11.130
to see Guinea worm gone from this planet.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.232
Incredible advice.

00:07:13.232 --> 00:07:13.833
Live for us,

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:15.301
director of the Carter Center's

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:17.203
Guinea Worm Eradication Program.

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:18.871
Thank you so much for being on the show.

